#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD9999 expect=noViolation domain=ADXX
#note "The same dataset with Define-XML class 'BASIC DATA STRUCTURE' - one of the three supported ADaM structures - so the containment check holds and the rule stays quiet. An inverted membership test (firing on a supported structure) reds this scenario."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#define dataset-class ADXX "BASIC DATA STRUCTURE"
dataset ADXX label="Analysis Dataset"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
S1 | 001
